  PopupType: 10
  InterruptsMovement: 1
  Title: "La musica di \u201CCenerentola\u201D di Prokof\u2019ev"
  TitleKey: 
  SubTitle: Seleziona la risposta corretta
  SubTitleKey: hotspot/linear_quiz_text/subtitle
  Type: 0
  ProfilingData: {fileID: 0}
  Questions:
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Chi ha composto il balletto Cenerentola?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Sergei Prokofiev
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Ludwig van Beethoven
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Come viene descritta la musica al ballo nel testo?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Come marce lente in 4 tempi
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Come ninne nanne tranquille in 2 tempi
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: 'Come splendidi valzer in 3 tempi: UNO-due-tre'
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Come musica rock molto forte con chitarre
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Che cosa succede alla musica a mezzanotte nella storia?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Si ferma completamente e c\u2019\xE8 silenzio"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Diventa veloce e forte, come una sveglia musicale
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Si trasforma in una lenta canzone d\u2019amore"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Sembra una ninna nanna per bambini
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Nella semplice attivit\xE0 in classe, che cosa viene chiesto agli studenti
        di fare mentre ascoltano la musica?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Scrivere tre parole che descrivono la musica, indovinare quale parte
          della storia potrebbe essere e fare un piccolo disegno
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Imparare a memoria tutte le date della vita del compositore
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Ballare tutto il balletto dall\u2019inizio alla fine"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Scrivere un lungo tema su ogni strumento dell\u2019orchestra"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
